 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nRandstad Componenten BV\nKeizersgracht 12, 1015 CX Amsterdam, Netherlands\nBTW-nummer: NL890258749B01\n\nMASTER SERVICES\nAGREEMENT\n\nBETAALD [circled]\n\nFROM\n\nRandstad Componenten BV\nKeizersgracht 12\n1015 CX Amsterdam\nNetherlands\nVAT: NL890258749B01\n\nFACTUURADRES\nVan Dijk Handel BV\nIndustrieweg 88\n1015 CX Amsterdam\nNetherlands\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 14-04-2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and between Randstad\nComponenten BV, with its registered office at Keizersgracht 12, Amsterdam (\"Party A\"), and Van Dijk Handel BV, with its registered office\nat Industrieweg 88, Amsterdam (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 36 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in accordance with\nSection 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the purposes of this\nAgreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of England and Wales.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A    Randstad Componenten BV / Emma Bakker\nParty B    Van Dijk Handel BV / Emma Bakker\nDate       14-04-2026",
